#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:558
msgid "Off – show one example"
msgstr "Uit – één voorbeeld tonen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:562
msgid "Change preview examples"
msgstr "Voorbeelden in de voorbeeldweergave wisselen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:564
msgid ""
"How often the live preview switches to the next code type. Pausing is always"
" possible with the button next to the input field."
msgstr ""
"Hoe vaak de live-voorbeeldweergave naar het volgende codetype gaat. Pauzeren"
" kan altijd met de knop naast het invoerveld."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:568
msgid "Fade between examples"
msgstr "Overgang tussen voorbeelden"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:570
msgid "Off – switch instantly"
msgstr "Uit – direct wisselen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:571
msgid "Very fast (0.2 s)"
msgstr "Zeer snel (0,2 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:572
msgid "Fast (0.35 s)"
msgstr "Snel (0,35 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:573
msgid "Normal (0.6 s)"
msgstr "Normaal (0,6 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:574
msgid "Slow (1 s)"
msgstr "Langzaam (1 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:575
msgid "Very slow (1.5 s)"
msgstr "Zeer langzaam (1,5 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:577
msgid ""
"How softly one example blends into the next. With “Reduce motion” in the "
"operating system, the examples only cross-fade, without movement."
msgstr ""
"Hoe zacht het ene voorbeeld overgaat in het volgende. Met ‘Beweging "
"verminderen’ in het besturingssysteem worden de voorbeelden alleen "
"overgevloeid, zonder beweging."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:581
msgid "Links & behaviour"
msgstr "Links en gedrag"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:582
msgid "Link barcodes"
msgstr "Barcodes koppelen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:582
msgid "Clicking a barcode opens a product page (see “Link target”)."
msgstr "Een klik op een barcode opent een productpagina (zie ‘Linkdoel’)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:583
msgid "Automatic – matching data source"
msgstr "Automatisch – bijpassende gegevensbron"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:589
msgid "Own URL template"
msgstr "Eigen URL-sjabloon"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:590
msgid "Link target"
msgstr "Linkdoel"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:590
msgid ""
"“Automatic” links to the data source that delivered the product data. "
"Without product data, books go to Open Library and other codes to ean-"
"search.org (its product pages are public, no token needed). If a chosen site"
" does not cover a code, “Automatic” is used."
msgstr ""
"‘Automatisch’ linkt naar de gegevensbron die de productgegevens leverde. "
"Zonder productgegevens gaan boeken naar Open Library en andere codes naar "
"ean-search.org (de productpagina’s zijn openbaar, geen token nodig). Als de "
"gekozen site een code niet dekt, wordt ‘Automatisch’ gebruikt."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:591
msgid "URL template"
msgstr "URL-sjabloon"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:591
msgid ""
"<code>{code}</code> is replaced by the EAN/ISBN (13 digits), e.g. a search "
"in your own shop."
msgstr ""
"<code>{code}</code> wordt vervangen door de EAN/ISBN (13 cijfers), bijv. een"
" zoekopdracht in de eigen webwinkel."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:594
msgid "Open links in a new tab"
msgstr "Links in een nieuw tabblad openen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:595
msgid "Add rel=\"nofollow\""
msgstr "rel=\"nofollow\" toevoegen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:595
msgid "Recommended for SEO when you show many barcodes."
msgstr "Aanbevolen voor SEO als er veel barcodes worden getoond."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:598
msgid "Invalid codes"
msgstr "Ongeldige codes"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:600
msgid "Hint for editors"
msgstr "Hint voor redacteuren"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:601
msgid "Show as text"
msgstr "Als tekst tonen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:604
msgid ""
"“Hint for editors” shows the reason (e.g. wrong check digit) to logged-in "
"editors only – visitors see nothing."
msgstr ""
"‘Hint voor redacteuren’ toont de reden (bijv. verkeerd controlecijfer) "
"alleen aan ingelogde redacteuren – bezoekers zien niets."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:606
msgid "Custom field for the EAN"
msgstr "Aangepast veld voor de EAN"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:606
msgid ""
"Used when a shortcode has no <code>ean</code> or <code>isbn</code> "
"attribute. The WooCommerce GTIN (also from Germanized, German Market and EAN"
" for WooCommerce) and fields named <code>ean</code> or <code>isbn</code> are"
" detected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Gebruikt als een shortcode geen attribuut <code>ean</code> of "
"<code>isbn</code> heeft. De WooCommerce-GTIN (ook van Germanized, German "
"Market en EAN for WooCommerce) en velden met de naam <code>ean</code> of "
"<code>isbn</code> worden automatisch herkend."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:616 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:907
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1017 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:113
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:121
msgid "Barcode"
msgstr "Barcode"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:616
msgid "Changes are shown instantly in the preview."
msgstr "Wijzigingen verschijnen direct in de voorbeeldweergave."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:617
msgid "Bar width"
msgstr "Streepbreedte"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:617
msgid "px / module"
msgstr "px / module"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:617
msgid ""
"Thickness of the thinnest bar. 2 px is good for screens, 3 px+ for scanning "
"from paper."
msgstr ""
"Dikte van de dunste streep. 2 px is goed voor schermen, 3 px of meer voor "
"scannen van papier."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:618
msgid "Bar height"
msgstr "Streephoogte"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:619
msgid "Show digits below the bars"
msgstr "Cijfers onder de strepen tonen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:620 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:149
msgid "Show “ISBN …”, “ISSN …” or “ISMN …” above the bars"
msgstr "‘ISBN …’, ‘ISSN …’ of ‘ISMN …’ boven de strepen tonen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:620
msgid ""
"Like on a book cover. ISBNs (978/979… or ISBN-10), ISSNs (977…) and ISMNs "
"(979-0…) are detected automatically. Enter the number with hyphens to have "
"them printed, e.g. 978-3-16-148410-0."
msgstr ""
"Zoals op een boekomslag. ISBN’s (978/979… of ISBN-10), ISSN’s (977…) en "
"ISMN’s (979-0…) worden automatisch herkend. Voer het nummer met streepjes in"
" om ze mee te laten drukken, bijv. 978-3-16-148410-0."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:621 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1055
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:146
msgid "Bar color"
msgstr "Streepkleur"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:624 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:147
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Achtergrond"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:629
msgid "transparent"
msgstr "transparant"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:632
msgid ""
"Tip: Scanners need good contrast – dark bars on a light background work "
"best."
msgstr ""
"Tip: scanners hebben goed contrast nodig – donkere strepen op een lichte "
"achtergrond werken het best."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:635
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Lay-out"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:638 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1042
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "Uitlijning"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:640
msgid "Theme default"
msgstr "Standaard van het thema"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:641 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1045
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Links"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:642 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1046
msgid "Center"
msgstr "Midden"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:643 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1047
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Rechts"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:648 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1049
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:129
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stijl"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:650 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1052
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:130
msgid "Plain"
msgstr "Eenvoudig"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:651 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1053
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:131
msgid "Card"
msgstr "Kaart"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:653
msgid "“Card” adds a subtle frame with rounded corners."
msgstr "‘Kaart’ voegt een subtiel kader met afgeronde hoeken toe."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:655
msgid "Show product name below the barcode"
msgstr "Productnaam onder de barcode tonen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:655
msgid "The name comes from the active data sources."
msgstr "De naam komt uit de actieve gegevensbronnen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:658
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "Weergave-engine"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:661 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:150
msgid "Generate barcode"
msgstr "Barcode genereren"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:663 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:151
msgid "Locally (SVG, recommended)"
msgstr "Lokaal (SVG, aanbevolen)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:664 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:152
msgid "Via ean-search.org (PNG)"
msgstr "Via ean-search.org (PNG)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:666
msgid ""
"Local SVGs are razor-sharp, fast and need no requests to other services. The"
" ean-search.org image needs an ean-search.org token; if it fails, the local "
"renderer is used automatically."
msgstr ""
"Lokale SVG’s zijn haarscherp, snel en hebben geen verzoeken aan andere "
"diensten nodig. De afbeelding van ean-search.org vereist een ean-search.org-"
"token; als dat mislukt, wordt automatisch lokaal gegenereerd."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:670 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:153
msgid "Embed as"
msgstr "Insluiten als"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:672 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:154
msgid "Inline SVG"
msgstr "Inline SVG"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:673 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:155
msgid "Image (<img>)"
msgstr "Afbeelding (<img>)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:675
msgid "“Image” lets visitors save the barcode via right click."
msgstr ""
"Met ‘Afbeelding’ kunnen bezoekers de barcode via rechtsklikken opslaan."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:686
msgid ""
"Product names and product cards come from these services, asked from top to "
"bottom. If a service does not know a code or does not answer, the next one "
"is asked. Barcodes themselves never need a data source."
msgstr ""
"Productnamen en productkaarten komen van deze diensten, van boven naar "
"beneden bevraagd. Als een dienst een code niet kent of niet antwoordt, wordt"
" de volgende bevraagd. Barcodes zelf hebben nooit een gegevensbron nodig."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:692
msgid ""
"Open databases are maintained by volunteers and may contain mistakes. In the"
" block editor, a fetched name can be corrected before publishing."
msgstr ""
"Open databases worden door vrijwilligers bijgehouden en kunnen fouten "
"bevatten. In de blokeditor kan een opgehaalde naam vóór publicatie worden "
"gecorrigeerd."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:695
msgid "Connection & cache"
msgstr "Verbinding en cache"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:695
msgid ""
"Product data rarely changes. Caching saves requests and keeps your pages "
"fast."
msgstr ""
"Productgegevens veranderen zelden. De cache bespaart verzoeken en houdt de "
"pagina’s snel."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:696
msgid "Request timeout"
msgstr "Time-out voor verzoeken"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:696
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "seconden"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:697
msgid "Keep product data for"
msgstr "Productgegevens bewaren gedurende"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:697
msgid "days"
msgstr "dagen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:697
msgid "0 disables the cache (not recommended)."
msgstr "0 schakelt de cache uit (niet aanbevolen)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:698
msgid "Clear cache"
msgstr "Cache legen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:698
msgid "Fetch all product data fresh on the next page view."
msgstr "Alle productgegevens bij de volgende paginaweergave opnieuw ophalen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:699
msgid "Clear now"
msgstr "Nu legen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:721
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Instellingen opslaan"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:729
msgid "Live preview"
msgstr "Live-voorbeeld"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:729
msgid "Uses your current, unsaved settings."
msgstr "Gebruikt de huidige, nog niet opgeslagen instellingen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:734
msgid "EAN or ISBN for the preview"
msgstr "EAN of ISBN voor het voorbeeld"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:748
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "Snel aan de slag"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:750
msgid ""
"Paste into any post, page or widget. In the block editor, search for the "
"“EAN & ISBN Barcode” block."
msgstr ""
"In elk bericht, elke pagina of widget plakken. Zoek in de blokeditor naar "
"het blok ‘EAN- & ISBN-barcode’."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:789
msgid ""
"Switches all data sources on and restores their order, the timeout and the "
"cache time. API tokens are kept. Nothing changes until you save."
msgstr ""
"Schakelt alle gegevensbronnen in en herstelt hun volgorde, de time-out en de"
" cacheduur. API-tokens blijven behouden. Er verandert pas iets na het "
"opslaan."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:790
msgid "Empties the builder fields and starts again with the example code."
msgstr ""
"Leegt de velden van de generator en begint opnieuw met de voorbeeldcode."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:792
msgid ""
"Sets everything on this tab back to the defaults. Nothing changes until you "
"save."
msgstr ""
"Zet alles op dit tabblad terug naar de standaardwaarden. Er verandert pas "
"iets na het opslaan."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:796
msgid "Reset this tab"
msgstr "Dit tabblad terugzetten"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:806
msgid "EAN-13 – the usual product code in Europe"
msgstr "EAN-13 – de gangbare productcode in Europa"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:807
msgid "EAN-8 – short code for small packages"
msgstr "EAN-8 – korte code voor kleine verpakkingen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:808
msgid "UPC-A – product code in the USA and Canada"
msgstr "UPC-A – productcode in de VS en Canada"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:809
msgid "UPC-E – short form of UPC-A"
msgstr "UPC-E – korte vorm van UPC-A"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:810
msgid "ISBN – book with the “ISBN …” line"
msgstr "ISBN – boek met de regel ‘ISBN …’"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:811
msgid "ISBN + price"
msgstr "ISBN + prijs"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:811
msgid "Book with a 5-digit price add-on (5 = US dollars, 24.99)"
msgstr "Boek met 5-cijferige prijs-add-on (5 = Amerikaanse dollar, 24,99)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:812
msgid "ISSN + issue"
msgstr "ISSN + nummer"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:812
msgid "ISSN – periodical with issue number 05 as add-on"
msgstr "ISSN – tijdschrift met uitgavenummer 05 als add-on"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:813
msgid "ISMN – sheet music"
msgstr "ISMN – bladmuziek"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:814
msgid "QR code"
msgstr "QR-code"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:814
msgid "QR code with the GS1 Digital Link of the product"
msgstr "QR-code met de GS1 Digital Link van het product"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:816
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Voorbeelden"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:834 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:908
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1020 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:116
msgid "QR code (GS1 Digital Link)"
msgstr "QR-code (GS1 Digital Link)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:834
msgid ""
"The QR code contains a web address with the GTIN. Phones open it, and "
"2D-capable checkout scanners read the GTIN from it – the successor of the "
"classic barcode (GS1 “Sunrise 2027”)."
msgstr ""
"De QR-code bevat een webadres met de GTIN. Smartphones openen het, en "
"kassascanners met 2D-ondersteuning lezen er de GTIN uit – de opvolger van de"
" klassieke barcode (GS1 ‘Sunrise 2027’)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:838
msgid "Web address in the QR code"
msgstr "Webadres in de QR-code"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:840
msgid "GS1 (id.gs1.org) – works without setup"
msgstr "GS1 (id.gs1.org) – werkt zonder instellen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:841
msgid "This website – leads to the product in the shop"
msgstr "Deze website – leidt naar het product in de webwinkel"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:842
msgid "Own resolver domain"
msgstr "Eigen resolver-domein"

#. translators: 1: example address with GS1, 2: example address with this
#. website
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:846
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Example: %1$s. With “This website” the code reads %2$s; the plugin then "
"forwards to the WooCommerce product with this GTIN, otherwise to the link "
"target."
msgstr ""
"Voorbeeld: %1$s. Met ‘Deze website’ wordt de code %2$s; de plugin stuurt dan"
" door naar het WooCommerce-product met deze GTIN, anders naar het linkdoel."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:855
msgid ""
"“This website” needs speaking permalinks (not “Plain”). Until then, GS1 is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"‘Deze website’ vereist leesbare permalinks (niet ‘Eenvoudig’). Tot die tijd "
"wordt GS1 gebruikt."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:857
msgid "Change permalinks"
msgstr "Permalinks wijzigen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:861
msgid "Resolver domain"
msgstr "Resolver-domein"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:861
msgid ""
"A domain that answers GS1 Digital Link addresses (…/01/{GTIN}), e.g. from "
"your GS1 organisation or ERP."
msgstr ""
"Een domein dat GS1 Digital Link-adressen (…/01/{GTIN}) beantwoordt, bijv. "
"van de eigen GS1-organisatie of het ERP-systeem."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:864
msgid "QR code size"
msgstr "Grootte van de QR-code"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:864
msgid "px per square"
msgstr "px per vierkantje"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:864
msgid "For print, at least 0.4 mm per square is recommended."
msgstr "Voor drukwerk wordt minimaal 0,4 mm per vierkantje aanbevolen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:867
msgid "Error correction"
msgstr "Foutcorrectie"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:869
msgid "L – smallest code (7 %)"
msgstr "L – kleinste code (7 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:870
msgid "M – recommended (15 %)"
msgstr "M – aanbevolen (15 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:871
msgid "Q – robust (25 %)"
msgstr "Q – robuust (25 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:872
msgid "H – very robust (30 %)"
msgstr "H – zeer robuust (30 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:874
msgid "How much of the code may be damaged or covered and still be read."
msgstr ""
"Hoeveel van de code beschadigd of bedekt mag zijn terwijl hij nog leesbaar "
"is."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:892
msgid "Product page"
msgstr "Productpagina"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:892
msgid ""
"Shows the barcode of the product’s GTIN in the shop. For variable products, "
"the barcode changes with the selected variation."
msgstr ""
"Toont de barcode van de GTIN van het product in de webwinkel. Bij variabele "
"producten wisselt de barcode met de gekozen variatie."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:895
msgid "Barcode on the product page"
msgstr "Barcode op de productpagina"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:897
msgid "Do not show"
msgstr "Niet tonen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:898
msgid "With SKU and categories"
msgstr "Bij SKU en categorieën"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:899
msgid "Below the product summary"
msgstr "Onder de productsamenvatting"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:901
msgid ""
"Size and colours follow the “Appearance” tab. Products without a GTIN show "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"Grootte en kleuren volgen het tabblad ‘Weergave’. Producten zonder GTIN "
"tonen niets."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:905
msgid "Code type"
msgstr "Codetype"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:909
msgid "Barcode and QR code"
msgstr "Barcode en QR-code"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:914
msgid "Product management"
msgstr "Productbeheer"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:915
msgid "GTIN column in the product list"
msgstr "GTIN-kolom in de productlijst"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:915
msgid ""
"Small barcode with the code; invalid GTINs (e.g. wrong check digit) are "
"marked in red."
msgstr ""
"Kleine barcode met de code; ongeldige GTIN’s (bijv. verkeerd controlecijfer)"
" worden rood gemarkeerd."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:916
msgid "Look up product data in the product editor"
msgstr "Productgegevens opzoeken in de producteditor"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:916
msgid ""
"Button next to the GTIN field: shows name, brand or author from the data "
"sources and can take the name over as product name."
msgstr ""
"Knop naast het GTIN-veld: toont naam, merk of auteur uit de gegevensbronnen "
"en kan de naam overnemen als productnaam."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:919
msgid "GTIN fields"
msgstr "GTIN-velden"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:919
msgid ""
"The GTIN is read from these fields, top to bottom. Developers can add more "
"via the “eanbc_gtin_meta_keys” filter."
msgstr ""
"De GTIN wordt uit deze velden gelezen, van boven naar beneden. Ontwikkelaars"
" kunnen er meer toevoegen via de filter ‘eanbc_gtin_meta_keys’."

