msgid "Caption"
msgstr "Bijschrift"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1083
msgid ""
"Barcode. Aliases: [ean] and [ean_barcode] (the latter always works, even if "
"another plugin uses [barcode])."
msgstr ""
"Barcode. Aliassen: [ean] en [ean_barcode] (de laatste werkt altijd, ook als "
"een andere plugin [barcode] gebruikt)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1084
msgid "Short form without attribute name."
msgstr "Korte vorm zonder attribuutnaam."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1085
msgid "GTIN-14 with leading zero is converted to EAN-13 automatically."
msgstr "GTIN-14 met voorloopnul wordt automatisch omgezet naar EAN-13."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1086
msgid ""
"Without EAN: uses the custom field of the current post or the WooCommerce "
"GTIN."
msgstr ""
"Zonder EAN: gebruikt het aangepaste veld van het huidige bericht of de "
"WooCommerce-GTIN."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1087
msgid "Product card with barcode, name and details from the data sources."
msgstr "Productkaart met barcode, naam en details uit de gegevensbronnen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1088
msgid "Only the product name as text – great inside tables and lists."
msgstr "Alleen de productnaam als tekst – ideaal in tabellen en lijsten."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1089
msgid ""
"Book barcode with the “ISBN …” line above the bars. Alias: [isbn_barcode] "
"(always works, even if another plugin uses [isbn])."
msgstr ""
"Boekbarcode met de regel ‘ISBN …’ boven de strepen. Alias: [isbn_barcode] "
"(werkt altijd, ook als een andere plugin [isbn] gebruikt)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1090
msgid "ISBN-10 is converted to ISBN-13 (978…) automatically."
msgstr "ISBN-10 wordt automatisch omgezet naar ISBN-13 (978…)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1091
msgid ""
"Product card for a book: title, author, publisher, ISBN-13 and ISBN-10."
msgstr ""
"Productkaart voor een boek: titel, auteur, uitgever, ISBN-13 en ISBN-10."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1092
msgid "Only the book title as text."
msgstr "Alleen de boektitel als tekst."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1093
msgid ""
"With a 5-digit add-on, e.g. the price on books (5 = US dollars, 2499 = "
"24.99)."
msgstr ""
"Met een 5-cijferige add-on, bijv. de prijs op boeken (5 = Amerikaanse "
"dollar, 2499 = 24,99)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1094
msgid ""
"Periodical: the ISSN becomes an EAN-13 with 977, the 2-digit add-on is the "
"issue number."
msgstr ""
"Tijdschrift: de ISSN wordt een EAN-13 met 977, de 2-cijferige add-on is het "
"uitgavenummer."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1095
msgid ""
"Sheet music (ISMN) with the “ISMN …” line. Old ISMNs starting with M are "
"converted."
msgstr ""
"Bladmuziek (ISMN) met de regel ‘ISMN …’. Oude ISMN’s die met M beginnen "
"worden omgezet."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1096
msgid ""
"UPC-E – the short form of UPC-A for small packages. Use type=\"upce\" to "
"shorten a UPC-A."
msgstr ""
"UPC-E – de korte vorm van UPC-A voor kleine verpakkingen. Gebruik "
"type=\"upce\" om een UPC-A in te korten."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1097
msgid ""
"QR code with the GS1 Digital Link: phones open the product’s web address, "
"2D-capable checkout scanners read the GTIN. Alias: [gs1_qr]."
msgstr ""
"QR-code met de GS1 Digital Link: smartphones openen het webadres van het "
"product, kassascanners met 2D-ondersteuning lezen de GTIN. Alias: [gs1_qr]."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1098
msgid "QR code with batch and serial number, e.g. for labels."
msgstr "QR-code met partij- en serienummer, bijv. voor etiketten."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1109
msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "Attributen"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1109
msgid ""
"All attributes are optional and override the global settings for a single "
"barcode."
msgstr ""
"Alle attributen zijn optioneel en overschrijven de algemene instellingen "
"voor één barcode."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1111
msgid ""
"EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, ISBN-13, ISBN-10, ISSN, ISMN or GTIN-14 with "
"leading zero. Spaces and dashes are ignored. An add-on can follow after a "
"space or “+”."
msgstr ""
"EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, ISBN-13, ISBN-10, ISSN, ISMN of GTIN-14 met "
"voorloopnul. Spaties en streepjes worden genegeerd. Na een spatie of ‘+’ kan"
" een add-on volgen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1112
msgid "Same as ean – use whichever reads better."
msgstr "Hetzelfde als ean – gebruik wat het best leest."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1113
msgid "Like ean, but for an ISSN (periodical) or ISMN (sheet music)."
msgstr "Zoals ean, maar voor een ISSN (tijdschrift) of ISMN (bladmuziek)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1114
msgid ""
"Force a format, e.g. show a UPC-A as EAN-13 or UPC-E, or a book ISBN as "
"plain EAN-13 without the ISBN line."
msgstr ""
"Een formaat afdwingen, bijv. een UPC-A tonen als EAN-13 of UPC-E, of een "
"boek-ISBN als gewone EAN-13 zonder ISBN-regel."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1115
msgid ""
"2- or 5-digit add-on to the right of the barcode: issue number of "
"periodicals or price on books."
msgstr ""
"2- of 5-cijferige add-on rechts van de barcode: uitgavenummer van "
"tijdschriften of prijs op boeken."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1116
msgid "Bar width in px per module."
msgstr "Streepbreedte in px per module."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1117
msgid "Bar height in px."
msgstr "Streephoogte in px."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1118
msgid "Show digits below the bars."
msgstr "Cijfers onder de strepen tonen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1119
msgid "Show “ISBN …”, “ISSN …” or “ISMN …” above the bars."
msgstr "‘ISBN …’, ‘ISSN …’ of ‘ISMN …’ boven de strepen tonen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1120
msgid "Show the product name from the data sources."
msgstr "De productnaam uit de gegevensbronnen tonen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1121
msgid "Link to a product page (see “Link target” in the settings)."
msgstr "Linken naar een productpagina (zie ‘Linkdoel’ in de instellingen)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1122
msgid "Own link target for this barcode, e.g. your product page."
msgstr "Eigen linkdoel voor deze barcode, bijv. de eigen productpagina."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1123
msgid "QR code only: batch/lot and serial number (max. 20 characters each)."
msgstr "Alleen QR-code: partij/lot en serienummer (elk max. 20 tekens)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1124
msgid "QR code only: size of one square in px."
msgstr "Alleen QR-code: grootte van één vierkantje in px."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1125
msgid ""
"QR code only: error correction – higher survives more damage, but makes the "
"code denser."
msgstr ""
"Alleen QR-code: foutcorrectie – hoger verdraagt meer schade, maar maakt de "
"code dichter."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1126
msgid "Alignment."
msgstr "Uitlijning."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1127
msgid "Look."
msgstr "Uiterlijk."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1128
msgid "Bar color."
msgstr "Streepkleur."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1129
msgid "Background color or transparent."
msgstr "Achtergrondkleur of transparant."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1130
msgid "Render locally (SVG) or fetch a PNG from ean-search.org."
msgstr "Lokaal genereren (SVG) of een PNG van ean-search.org ophalen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1131
msgid "Embed as inline SVG or as image."
msgstr "Insluiten als inline SVG of als afbeelding."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1132 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1133
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1137
msgid "any text"
msgstr "willekeurige tekst"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1132
msgid ""
"Own product name. Replaces the name from the data sources; no request is "
"needed for it."
msgstr ""
"Eigen productnaam. Vervangt de naam uit de gegevensbronnen; er is geen "
"verzoek voor nodig."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1133
msgid "Caption below the barcode."
msgstr "Bijschrift onder de barcode."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1134
msgid "Read the EAN from this custom field."
msgstr "De EAN uit dit aangepaste veld lezen."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1135
msgid "Post ID to read the custom field from (default: current post)."
msgstr ""
"ID van het bericht waaruit het aangepaste veld wordt gelezen (standaard: "
"huidig bericht)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1136
msgid "Additional CSS class."
msgstr "Extra CSS-class."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1137
msgid ""
"Text if no product data is found ([ean_name], [ean_product], [isbn_name], "
"[isbn_product])."
msgstr ""
"Tekst als er geen productgegevens worden gevonden ([ean_name], "
"[ean_product], [isbn_name], [isbn_product])."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1139
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "Attribuut"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1139
msgid "Values"
msgstr "Waarden"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1139
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschrijving"

#. translators: %s: plugin version
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1156
#, php-format
msgid "Version %s"
msgstr "Versie %s"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1157
msgid "Report a bug or suggest a feature"
msgstr "Een fout melden of een wens doorgeven"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1160
msgid "Improve the translation"
msgstr "De vertaling verbeteren"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1165
msgid ""
"Privacy: barcodes are created on this server. Product data is only requested"
" from the data sources that are switched on – the requests contain the "
"product code, never data about visitors."
msgstr ""
"Privacy: barcodes worden op deze server gemaakt. Productgegevens worden "
"alleen opgevraagd bij ingeschakelde gegevensbronnen – de verzoeken bevatten "
"de productcode, nooit gegevens over bezoekers."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1167
msgid "Text for the privacy policy"
msgstr "Tekst voor de privacyverklaring"

#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:62
msgid "The add-on must have 2 or 5 digits."
msgstr "De add-on moet 2 of 5 cijfers hebben."

#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:109
msgid "No EAN given."
msgstr "Geen EAN opgegeven."

#. translators: %s: correct check digit (0-9 or X)
#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:124
#, php-format
msgid "Invalid ISSN check digit – the last character should be %s."
msgstr "Ongeldig ISSN-controlecijfer – het laatste teken moet %s zijn."

#. translators: %s: correct check digit (0-9 or X)
#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:142
#, php-format
msgid "Invalid ISBN-10 check digit – the last character should be %s."
msgstr "Ongeldig ISBN-10-controlecijfer – het laatste teken moet %s zijn."

#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:157
msgid "An EAN may only contain digits (an ISBN-10 may end with X)."
msgstr "Een EAN mag alleen cijfers bevatten (een ISBN-10 mag op X eindigen)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:176
msgid "This is an ISMN (sheet music), not an ISBN."
msgstr "Dit is een ISMN (bladmuziek), geen ISBN."

#: includes/class-eanbc-barcode.php:177
msgid ""
"This is not an ISBN. Use an ISBN-13 (starting with 978 or 979) or an "
"ISBN-10."
msgstr ""
